Task: Flatten a dict that may contain nested dicts as values into a single-level dict, joining the path of keys with '.' (e.g. {'a': {'b': 1}} becomes {'a.b': 1}). Leaf (non-dict) values are copied as-is. An empty dict returns an empty dict.
